---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import Tabs from '../../components/Tabs.astro';
import RuntimeCodeTabs from '../../components/RuntimeCodeTabs.astro';
---

<DocsLayout
  title="Install hitlimit - npm Rate Limiter for Node.js, Express, NestJS, Bun"
  description="Install hitlimit rate limiting package via npm, pnpm, yarn, or bun. Quick setup guide for Express.js, NestJS, Bun.serve, and Elysia applications with memory, SQLite, or Redis stores."
  keywords="npm install hitlimit, rate limit npm, install rate limiter, express rate limit install, nestjs throttler install, bun rate limit, hitlimit-bun install, nodejs rate limiter setup"
>
  <h1>Installation</h1>

  <p>Install hitlimit using your preferred package manager.</p>

  <h2 id="install">Install the Package</h2>

  <RuntimeCodeTabs
    node='npm install @joint-ops/hitlimit\n<span class="cm"># or: pnpm add @joint-ops/hitlimit</span>\n<span class="cm"># or: yarn add @joint-ops/hitlimit</span>'
    bun='bun add @joint-ops/hitlimit-bun'
  />

  <div data-runtime-content="bun">
    <p>
      The <code>hitlimit-bun</code> package is optimized specifically for Bun and includes
      native SQLite store support out of the box.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div data-runtime-content="bun">
    <h2 id="verify">Verify Installation</h2>

    <p>Create a test file to verify the installation:</p>

    <div class="code-block">
      <div class="code-header">
        <div class="code-dots">
          <span class="dot red"></span>
          <span class="dot yellow"></span>
          <span class="dot green"></span>
        </div>
        <span class="code-filename">test.ts</span>
      </div>
      <pre><code><span class="kw">import</span> {"{"} hitlimit {"}"} <span class="kw">from</span> <span class="str">'@joint-ops/hitlimit-bun'</span>

<span class="kw">const</span> limiter = <span class="fn">hitlimit</span>({"{"} limit: <span class="num">10</span>, window: <span class="str">'1m'</span> {"}"})

console.<span class="fn">log</span>(<span class="str">'hitlimit-bun installed successfully!'</span>)</code></pre>
    </div>

    <p>Run the test:</p>

    <Tabs tabs={[{ label: 'bun', content: 'bun run test.ts' }]} />
  </div>

  <h2 id="stores">Optional Store Packages</h2>

  <p>Install additional stores as needed:</p>

  <h3>Redis Store</h3>
  <p>Install the <code>ioredis</code> peer dependency to use the Redis store:</p>
  <RuntimeCodeTabs
    node='npm install ioredis\n<span class="cm"># or: pnpm add ioredis</span>'
    bun='bun add ioredis'
  />

  <h3>SQLite Store</h3>
  <RuntimeCodeTabs
    node='npm install better-sqlite3\n<span class="cm"># or: pnpm add better-sqlite3</span>'
    bun='<span class="cm"># Built-in! Bun includes bun:sqlite natively.</span>\n<span class="cm"># No additional package needed.</span>'
  />

  <h2 id="requirements">Requirements</h2>

  <div data-runtime-content="node">
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Node.js</strong>: v18.0.0 or higher</li>
      <li><strong>TypeScript</strong>: v5.0 or higher (optional)</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div data-runtime-content="bun">
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Bun</strong>: v1.0.0 or higher</li>
      <li><strong>TypeScript</strong>: v5.0 or higher (optional but recommended)</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <h2 id="next-steps">Next Steps</h2>

  <div data-runtime-content="node">
    <p>Now that you have hitlimit installed, head over to the <a href="/docs/quick-start">Quick Start</a> guide to set up your first rate limiter.</p>
  </div>

  <div data-runtime-content="bun">
    <p>Now that you have hitlimit-bun installed, proceed to the <a href="/docs/bun/quick-start">Quick Start</a> guide.</p>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>

<style>
  .code-block { margin: 1.5rem 0; border-radius: 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); background: var(--color-bg-surface); overflow: hidden; }
  .code-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); background: var(--color-bg-elevated); }
  .code-dots { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .dot { width: 0.75rem; height: 0.75rem; border-radius: 50%; }
  .dot.red { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.8); }
  .dot.yellow { background: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.8); }
  .dot.green { background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.8); }
  .code-filename { margin-left: 1rem; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); font-family: var(--font-mono); }
  .code-block pre { padding: 1.5rem; margin: 0; overflow-x: auto; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .code-block code { background: none !important; border: none !important; padding: 0 !important; }
  .kw { color: #c792ea; } .str { color: #a6e22e; } .num { color: #fd971f; } .fn { color: #66d9ef; }
</style>
